@startuml
title SABLE — Obligation and Authorization Domain Model
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
class CandidateSnapshot {
  snapshotId : Hash
  sourceRevision : String
}
class TerraformResource {
  address : String
  type : String
  attributes : Map
}
class SecurityObligation {
  obligationId : String
  kind : ObligationKind
  scope : String
  required : Boolean
}
class ResourceCorrespondence {
  baselineAddress : String
  candidateAddress : String
  confidence : MatchState
}
class Principal {
  identity : String
  kind : PrincipalKind
}
class AuthorizationStatement {
  actions : Set<String>
  resources : Set<String>
  effect : AllowOrDeny
  conditions : Map
}
class AuthorizationProjection {
  normalizedRules : Set
  completeness : ProjectionState
}
class ObligationAssessment {
  status : PRESERVED | REGRESSED | UNKNOWN
  rationale : String
}
CandidateSnapshot "1" *-- "0..*" TerraformResource : contains
TerraformResource "1" -- "0..*" SecurityObligation : entails
TerraformResource "1" -- "0..1" ResourceCorrespondence : mapped by
ResourceCorrespondence "1" --> "0..1" TerraformResource : candidate side
AuthorizationStatement "0..*" --> "1" Principal : subject
AuthorizationStatement "0..*" --> "0..*" TerraformResource : applies to
AuthorizationStatement "0..*" --> "1" AuthorizationProjection : normalized into
SecurityObligation "1" --> "0..1" ObligationAssessment : evaluated as
AuthorizationProjection "1" --> "0..*" ObligationAssessment : informs
note bottom
Conceptual domain view of supported local S3/IAM Terraform/HCL analysis.
Unknown is retained when parsing, matching, or projection is incomplete.
end note
@enduml
